# Atelier local overrides — copy to .env and uncomment as needed.
# devenv shell loads .env automatically (dotenv.enable = true in devenv.nix).
#
# Both Anthropic and Bedrock credentials can coexist. Set whichever
# apply — workloads pick the right provider based on model format.

# ── Anthropic direct API ────────────────────────────────────────
# Primary for local dev and BDD tests. Also serves as overwatch
# capability in production (onboarding, config assistance).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── AWS Bedrock ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Production default in CAI. Set model to an inference profile ARN.
# ATELIER_AGENT_MODEL=arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1:440464140575:inference-profile/us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-6-v1
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=...  (optional, for temporary credentials)

# ── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# devenv default: postgresql+psycopg://localhost:5533/atelier
# On CAI, PGlite starts automatically if ATELIER_DB_URL is unset.
# ATELIER_DB_URL=postgresql+psycopg://localhost:5533/atelier

# ── Qdrant ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# QDRANT_HOST=localhost
# QDRANT_PORT=6333
# QDRANT_GRPC_PORT=6334
